{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.avif?t=1773321058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras_big/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.webp?t=1773321058 width=1560 height=1356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live in a dystopian society </strong>where your job is to<strong> watch TV to earn money and purchase services </strong>to satisfy your needs.<strong> Investigate</strong> your surroundings and choose whether to<strong> be a good citizen\u2014or rebel. </strong>But remember: curiosity comes at a high price in this<strong> dystopian time management game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.poster.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.webm?t=1773321058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.mp4?t=1773321058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of Class-2 citizens, rewarded with a small apartment and a very simple job:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch television.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive a paycheck based on the channels you watch, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your money on various services to make life more comfortable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Investigate hidden objects or stories</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Collaborate  with the dissidents and rebel</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/83daaf647fddabb0e907e1c59b58327d.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through daily government broadcasts, citizens will be informed about the evolution of society and receive new items to spend their earnings on. They can enjoy a comfortable existence\u2014or risk breaking the rules and facing the consequences. But who ever said knowledge was free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/570f5c8ec90f201e4cc74101ccb708cd.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dystopicon</strong> is a game inspired by literary classics like <i>1984</i>, <i>Brave new world</i>,\u00a0<i>Ubik</i>, and the video game <i>Papers, please</i>. Tells its story through gameplay, written messages, and comic-style sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cb43d30cd623dc755b0a226682f9af7d.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cfe5e1eaf2dfccbdf215fbc1ff79fafd.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713750?t=1773321058","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3713750?t=1773321058","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/163b010aed23c510f531e35ed4bbba8e3bf1dcce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773321058","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/163b010aed23c510f531e35ed4bbba8e3bf1dcce/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773321058","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Mature Content Description\r\n\r\nThe developers describe the content like this:\r\n\r\nThis game contains references to sexual content and strong language.\r\nIt also includes depictions of drug and alcohol use, as well as the possibility of player-initiated suicide."},"demos":[{"appid":3930700,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.avif?t=1773321058\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras_big/34217c241b006543b9c6e6037dcd3628.webp?t=1773321058 width=1560 height=1356 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Live in a dystopian society </strong>where your job is to<strong> watch TV to earn money and purchase services </strong>to satisfy your needs.<strong> Investigate</strong> your surroundings and choose whether to<strong> be a good citizen\u2014or rebel. </strong>But remember: curiosity comes at a high price in this<strong> dystopian time management game.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.poster.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.webm?t=1773321058\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/eccbbf98900d3abc38f4621a0a26581c.mp4?t=1773321058\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players take on the role of Class-2 citizens, rewarded with a small apartment and a very simple job:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Watch television.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Receive a paycheck based on the channels you watch, </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Spend your money on various services to make life more comfortable.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Investigate hidden objects or stories</span></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_strike\">Collaborate  with the dissidents and rebel</span></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/83daaf647fddabb0e907e1c59b58327d.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Through daily government broadcasts, citizens will be informed about the evolution of society and receive new items to spend their earnings on. They can enjoy a comfortable existence\u2014or risk breaking the rules and facing the consequences. But who ever said knowledge was free?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/570f5c8ec90f201e4cc74101ccb708cd.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dystopicon</strong> is a game inspired by literary classics like <i>1984</i>, <i>Brave new world</i>,\u00a0<i>Ubik</i>, and the video game <i>Papers, please</i>. Tells its story through gameplay, written messages, and comic-style sequences.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cb43d30cd623dc755b0a226682f9af7d.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=876 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/extras/cfe5e1eaf2dfccbdf215fbc1ff79fafd.avif?t=1773321058\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Palitroque"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3713750/5264d41161578e6de8c01d447b58b00a76b10aed/header.jpg?t=1773321058","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstat